  "ingredients": [
    "1.25 cups all-purpose flour",
    "0.25 teaspoon salt",
    "0.5 cup butter, diced and then chilled",
    "0.25 cup ice cold water, or as needed"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/jqjui5XOWF2V78qSTuiijud0KWY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/24094-butter-flaky-pie-crust-ddmfs-ingredients-3x4-1368-224abc2d74a94249bf15e4864140962b.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/24094/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Combine flour and salt in a large bowl. Use a pastry blender to cut in chilled, diced butter until mixture resembles coarse crumbs.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/fqBPlEpYF0pybDfkIHluxrRB5xo=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/24094-butter-flaky-pie-crust-ddmfs-step-01-3x4-1369-d6c5f603d0d547ffbd11a7303f3970d1.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/24094/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add 1 tablespoon cold water at a time, mixing with a spatula or your hands until the dough comes together; you may need less than 1/4 cup water.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/nwJcD-mj4vJ1aGszK05XvTIaeXE=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/24094-butter-flaky-pie-crust-ddmfs-step-02-3x4-1371-6ffbf1b3d4184eea80eb2342d31353b3.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/24094/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Shape dough into a disc, wrap in plastic, and refrigerate for at least 4 hours or overnight.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/KZ6Y9itqnRAp2C-_5CyxPCeGZZA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/24094-butter-flaky-pie-crust-ddmfs-step-03-3x4-1372-88878e2542014fa08760718bdddecccc.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/24094/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place chilled dough on a generously floured surface and roll out to an 11-inch circle, adding more flour to your rolling pin as needed.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/NUhb7pWF-kq-rv8RMIwjneAxmnA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/24094-butter-flaky-pie-crust-ddmfs-step-04-3x4-1373-6b63babb786347bab5a4fce7b6045c6d.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/24094/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Carefully roll dough onto the rolling pin, then unroll over a 9-inch pie dish. Press dough evenly into the bottom and sides of the dish. Trim any excess dough and flute the edges.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/V3BH0C_C24mLC0IjJ4fgqqxQ9tk=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/24094-butter-flaky-pie-crust-ddmfs-step-06-3x4-1409-700cbcf10fe348ef862086518fa97247.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/24094/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Blind-bake or fill and bake as directed in your pie recipe.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/0RGfVlRKtIQkpSwJ-osbZN_cJOQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/24094-butter-flaky-pie-crust-ddmfs-step-07-3x4-1413-928f9b42c97f4e77930c7173f09c626f.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/24094/step_07.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Enjoy!",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/87HF97D9fKuoXG5N2sZhu0iWpqY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/24094-butter-flaky-pie-crust-ddmfs-hero-3x4-1427-a9bf8a3a6b454dca823384d63016864c.jpg"
